SOAPBOX: Fun working in this contest for an afternoon for a few hours. I luckily had a 20M band dipole ready, and it only took a little bit for work to set up a 15M Performer Vertical antenna with focus between 280 and 360 degrees. I was amazed that I seemed to get stations from all over, and they can hear me with my amp putting out between 50-80 watts on average. I would do it again for sure. Thank you for all that worked with me and were patient with me today. Glad to get on the air for this contest. 73!
